{"caption":"","data":"unsolved goals\ncase a\nd : ℕ\nA : ElectromagneticPotential d\n𝓕 : FreeSpace\nhA : ContDiff ℝ ∞ A.val\nJ : LorentzCurrentDensity d\nhJ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ J\nh : IsExtrema 𝓕 A J\nt : Time\nx : Space d\ni : Fin d\nhmax :\n  ∀ (t : Time) (x : Space d),\n    Space.div (electricField 𝓕.c A t) x = LorentzCurrentDensity.chargeDensity 𝓕.c J t x / 𝓕.ε₀ ∧\n      ∀ (i : Fin d),\n        𝓕.μ₀ * 𝓕.ε₀ * (∂ₜ (fun t => electricField 𝓕.c A t x) t).ofLp i =\n          ∑ j, Space.deriv j (fun x => magneticFieldMatrix 𝓕.c A t x (j, i)) x -\n            𝓕.μ₀ * (LorentzCurrentDensity.currentDensity 𝓕.c J t x).ofLp i\nhamp :\n  (fun s => ∂ₜ (fun x_1 => (electricField 𝓕.c A x_1 x).ofLp i) s) = fun s =>\n    1 / (𝓕.μ₀ * 𝓕.ε₀) * ∑ j, Space.deriv j (fun x => magneticFieldMatrix 𝓕.c A s x (j, i)) x -\n      1 / 𝓕.ε₀ * (LorentzCurrentDensity.currentDensity 𝓕.c J s x).ofLp i\nhgauss :\n  (fun y => ∑ j, Space.deriv j (fun x => (electricField 𝓕.c A t x).ofLp j) y) = fun y =>\n    LorentzCurrentDensity.chargeDensity 𝓕.c J t y / 𝓕.ε₀\nhamp' :\n  ∂ₜ (fun s => ∂ₜ (fun x_1 => (electricField 𝓕.c A x_1 x).ofLp i) s) t =\n    ∂ₜ\n      (fun s =>\n        𝓕.ε₀⁻¹ * 𝓕.μ₀⁻¹ * ∑ x_1, (fderiv ℝ (fun x => magneticFieldMatrix 𝓕.c A s x (x_1, i)) x) (Space.basis x_1) -\n          𝓕.ε₀⁻¹ * (LorentzCurrentDensity.currentDensity 𝓕.c J s x).ofLp i)\n      t\nhgauss' :\n  (fderiv ℝ (fun y => ∑ x, (fderiv ℝ (fun x_1 => (electricField 𝓕.c A t x_1).ofLp x) y) (Space.basis x)) x)\n      (Space.basis i) =\n    (fderiv ℝ (fun y => LorentzCurrentDensity.chargeDensity 𝓕.c J t y / 𝓕.ε₀) x) (Space.basis i)\n⊢ 𝓕.ε₀ *\n        (∂ₜ (∂ₜ fun x_1 => (electricField 𝓕.c A x_1 x).ofLp i) t +\n          (∂ₜ\n              (fun s =>\n                (∑ x_1, (fderiv ℝ (fun x => magneticFieldMatrix 𝓕.c A s x (x_1, i)) x) (Space.basis x_1) -\n                    𝓕.μ₀ * (LorentzCurrentDensity.currentDensity 𝓕.c J s x).ofLp i) /\n                  (𝓕.ε₀ * 𝓕.μ₀))\n              t +\n            𝓕.c.val ^ 2 *\n              (fderiv ℝ (fun y => ∑ x, (fderiv ℝ (fun x_1 => (electricField 𝓕.c A t x_1).ofLp x) y) (Space.basis x)) x)\n                (Space.basis i))) -\n      (𝓕.c.val ^ 2 *\n          (𝓕.ε₀ * ∑ x_1, Space.deriv x_1 (Space.deriv x_1 fun x => (electricField 𝓕.c A t x).ofLp i) x -\n              Space.deriv i (fun x => LorentzCurrentDensity.chargeDensity 𝓕.c J t x) x -\n            𝓕.ε₀ * 𝓕.μ₀ * ∂ₜ (fun x_1 => (LorentzCurrentDensity.currentDensity 𝓕.c J x_1 x).ofLp i) t) +\n        𝓕.ε₀ *\n          (∂ₜ (∂ₜ fun x_1 => (electricField 𝓕.c A x_1 x).ofLp i) t +\n            𝓕.c.val ^ 2 *\n              (fderiv ℝ (fun y => LorentzCurrentDensity.chargeDensity 𝓕.c J t y / 𝓕.ε₀) x) (Space.basis i))) =\n    𝓕.ε₀ * 0","endPos":{"column":23,"line":407},"fileName":"/Users/hellokitsch/_feynlang/leanProject/week4/experiment/runs/20261024T000653+0900/runs/V_B/P5/incomplete/B1/repeat_3/validation/lean/002_candidate_01/candidate.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"Tactic.unsolvedGoals","pos":{"column":60,"line":384},"severity":"error"}
